     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap TWHealthCheckLaboratoryMap</b></p><a name=\"TWHealthCheckLaboratoryMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcTWHealthCheckLaboratoryMap\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"ValueSet-VS-CoreDataset.html\">健康檢查核心檢驗項目值集（主管機關最小上傳集之檢驗子集）</a> to <a href=\"ValueSet-VS-CoreDataset.html\">健康檢查核心檢驗項目值集（主管機關最小上傳集之檢驗子集）</a></p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.0.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.0.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>804-5 (WBC [#/volume] in Blood by Manual count)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>6690-2 (Leukocytes [#/volume] in Blood)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>26464-8 (WBC [#/volume] in Blood)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>6690-2 (Leukocytes [#/volume] in Blood)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2888-6 (Protein [Mass/volume] in Urine)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>5804-0 (Protein [Mass/volume] in Urine by Test strip)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2339-0 (Glucose [Mass/volume] in Blood)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>1558-6 (Fasting Glucose [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>38483-4 (Creatinine [Mass/volume] in Blood)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>2160-0 (Creatinine [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>49154-8 (Uric acid [Mass/volume] in Blood)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>3084-1 (Uric acid [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>35200-5 (Cholesterol [Mass or Moles/volume] in Serum or Plasma)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>2093-3 (Cholesterol [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>3043-7 (Triglyceride [Mass/volume] in Blood)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>2571-8 (Triglyceride [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>13457-7 (Cholesterol in LDL [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma by calculation)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>2089-1 (Cholesterol in LDL [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>33914-3 (Glomerular filtration rate/1.73 sq M.predicted by MDRD equation)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>98979-8 (Glomerular filtration rate/1.73 sq M.predicted by Creatinine-based formula (CKD-EPI 2021))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>5195-3 (Hepatitis B virus surface Ag [Presence] in Serum)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>5196-1 (Hepatitis B virus surface Ag [Presence] in Serum)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>47365-2 (Hepatitis C virus Ab [Presence] in Blood)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relation